  "solution": {
    "text": "As with height <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> varies as<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/ci/image28-1bdd90fe-6681-42cf-bb82-68245ce815b1.jpg\" style=\"width: 210px; height: 175px;\" /><br /><br />and in accord with the figure <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> so <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> will be lesser than <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> and<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>mg</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>mg</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>mg</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mfrac><mi>GM</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>as</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>GM</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi>and</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>mhG</mi></mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>πR</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi>πρGmh</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>as</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>πR</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>",
